                </a>
              </figure>
            <% }); %>
          </div>
        </section>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
    <div class="bio-archive-note">
      <h3>Other ways of knowing</h3>
      <p>Gleb completed Sergey Maksimishin’s two-year “Photographer as Storyteller” course. His work also includes meditation and embodied practice, music, teaching and performance—different instruments for paying attention to what a system leaves out.</p>
